# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated by Tauri
# will have schema files for capabilities auto-completion
/gen/schemas

# Live-test fixtures. Two kinds, and only one of them is private.
#
# A reference image, a clip someone rendered, and whatever the last billed call
# returned are theirs and are large; they stay out, and the tests that want them
# skip where they are absent.
#
# The signed card set is neither. It is four tiny files generated as a fixture,
# and it is the only thing standing between the two halves of the update channel
# agreeing about Ed25519 and finding out they do not on somebody's machine. It
# has to travel with the tests that check it.
/tests/fixtures/*
!/tests/fixtures/signed-set/
